  "notes": "{違|ちが}う means to differ or to be wrong—a very common verb with two distinct uses.\n\nSENSE 1 - DIFFERENT:\n- XとYが{違|ちが}う: X and Y are different\n- Xと{違|ちが}って: unlike X\n- {全然|ぜんぜん}{違|ちが}う: completely different\n\nSENSE 2 - WRONG/INCORRECT:\n- {答|こた}えが{違|ちが}う: the answer is wrong\n- {違|ちが}います: No, that's not right (polite denial)\n- ちょっと{違|ちが}う: a bit wrong/off\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {違|ちが}い: difference (noun)\n- {間違|まちが}い: mistake\n- {間違|まちが}える: to make a mistake\n- {異|こと}なる: to differ (formal)",
